import ../../platform/browser/requests.dl

set view to a new UI view
set view's window to 41 as a pointer
set services to the browser UI service provider
set result to a UI call named "storage" containing "{\"text\":\"é😀\"}" through services in (the address of view)
require condition (result's success and (result's contents = "{\"stored\":\"é😀\"}")) reporting "The browser provider lost its owned UTF-8 result."
set failed to a UI call named "broken" containing "null" through services in (the address of view)
require condition ((failed's success = false) and (failed's contents' length = 0)) reporting "A failed browser service exposed its error details."
set request to a UI request named "language" containing "{\"operation\":\"project\"}" through services in (the address of view)
require condition (request = 7) reporting "The browser provider lost its request ID."
require condition (cancel UI request request through services in (the address of view)) reporting "The browser provider lost its cancellation."
print line "Browser capabilities implement the shared typed service contract."
